@startuml
title Abstract View Workflow

actor "User" as User
participant "View (any implementation)" as View
participant "Model (modeld)" as Model

== Initialization ==
View -> View : Connects to system D‑Bus
View -> Model : Subscribes to StateChanged signal
View -> Model : GetState() (initial full state)

== Rendering loop ==
loop On each StateChanged
    Model -> View : StateChanged(screen data)
    View -> View : Renders controls from screen\n(fields, buttons, tables, etc.)
    View -> User : Displays UI
end

== User input handling ==
User -> View : Interacts (click, text input, button press)
View -> View : Identifies affected control
View -> Model : Calls appropriate method:\nSelectScreen, SetControlValue,\nExecute, Stop, SendInput, GoBack

Model -> Model : Updates state
Model -> View : StateChanged (updated screen)
View -> View : Re-renders screen
View -> User : Updates UI

@enduml
